ure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186489169 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-9c3882c6-2da8-5fcb-8c4a-eadb749133f7"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-9c3882c6-2da8-5fcb-8c4a-eadb749133f7" :question/id #uuid "9c3882c6-2da8-5fcb-8c4a-eadb749133f7" :question/math-academy-id "q-357516" :question/problem "Convert $\\frac{253}{6}$ into a repeating decimal using long division." :question/worked-solution "To write the fraction as a decimal, we divide the numerator by the denominator:\n\n$$\n253÷6\n$$\n\nWe proceed using long division as usual, continuing until a repeating pattern of digits appears after the decimal point:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"150\">\n<br/><br/><table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\"></td>\n<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"7\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,\\,\\,4\\,2\\,.\\,1\\,6\\,6\\,…$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\">$6$</td>\n<td align=\"left\" colspan=\"7\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{2\\,\\phantom{|}5\\,\\phantom{|}3\\,.\\,0\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}0}$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td><td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$1$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-$</td><td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$6$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,6$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,0$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,3$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,6$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,⋮$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nWe could continue the division, but the same digit keeps repeating. Thus, the decimal continues with repeating $6$'s:\n\n$$\n42.166…\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{253}{6}=42.166…=42.1\\overset{―}{6}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c6059ab7-5ca5-52c9-ad6a-30214539ee65"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c6059ab7-5ca5-52c9-ad6a-30214539ee65" :answer-field/id #uuid "c6059ab7-5ca5-52c9-ad6a-30214539ee65" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-40019526-1666-5f1d-8230-6381166fb1c5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-43711b70-d073-5cbd-a084-cdf5e0e6cbd5" "answer-c0586438-67ae-5057-a65e-de88d395b4c2" "answer-40019526-1666-5f1d-8230-6381166fb1c5" "answer-17c3be89-aca7-5ac7-b8f7-e39eb22b9863" "answer-6d555af7-aaf2-50c3-91c0-af81c12d446a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-43711b70-d073-5cbd-a084-cdf5e0e6cbd5" :answer/id #uuid "43711b70-d073-5cbd-a084-cdf5e0e6cbd5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "41.1\\overset{―}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c0586438-67ae-5057-a65e-de88d395b4c2" :answer/id #uuid "c0586438-67ae-5057-a65e-de88d395b4c2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42.1\\overset{―}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-40019526-1666-5f1d-8230-6381166fb1c5" :answer/id #uuid "40019526-1666-5f1d-8230-6381166fb1c5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42.1\\overset{―}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-17c3be89-aca7-5ac7-b8f7-e39eb22b9863" :answer/id #uuid "17c3be89-aca7-5ac7-b8f7-e39eb22b9863" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42.6\\overset{―}{1}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6d555af7-aaf2-50c3-91c0-af81c12d446a" :answer/id #uuid "6d555af7-aaf2-50c3-91c0-af81c12d446a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "42.6\\overset{―}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186110620 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-0a65343e-809a-580c-9503-c6f1ca221068"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-0a65343e-809a-580c-9503-c6f1ca221068" :question/id #uuid "0a65343e-809a-580c-9503-c6f1ca221068" :question/math-academy-id "q-14753" :question/problem "Solve for $C$ where $\\frac{C-4}{3}=\\frac{C-2}{6}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we cross-multiply:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{C-4}{3} & =\\frac{C-2}{6} \\\\ (C-4)\\cdot 6 & =3\\cdot (C-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we proceed as usual to solve the equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(C-4)\\cdot 6 & =3\\cdot (C-2) \\\\ 6C-24 & =3C-6 \\\\ 6C-24-3C & =3C-6-3C \\\\ 3C-24 & =-6 \\\\ 3C-24+24 & =-6+24 \\\\ 3C & =18 \\\\ \\frac{3C}{3} & =\\frac{18}{3} \\\\ C & =6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, $C=6.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-e58248cb-cc47-5d46-bdcf-ee616fe70ffa"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-e58248cb-cc47-5d46-bdcf-ee616fe70ffa" :answer-field/id #uuid "e58248cb-cc47-5d46-bdcf-ee616fe70ffa" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-fd2d7f86-1899-5971-8da0-f2042a0e6b74" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7f05a7c3-f108-5a33-a17e-501c5172c2c9" "answer-aa5cff85-b17d-5788-a258-7f1b6edc431f" "answer-524035be-2593-5a4d-bfe2-d81c72edfd13" "answer-fd2d7f86-1899-5971-8da0-f2042a0e6b74" "answer-65c90b5a-a03b-5bf6-8480-c7c62bfe9030"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7f05a7c3-f108-5a33-a17e-501c5172c2c9" :answer/id #uuid "7f05a7c3-f108-5a33-a17e-501c5172c2c9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "C=2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-aa5cff85-b17d-5788-a258-7f1b6edc431f" :answer/id #uuid "aa5cff85-b17d-5788-a258-7f1b6edc431f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "C=3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-524035be-2593-5a4d-bfe2-d81c72edfd13" :answer/id #uuid "524035be-2593-5a4d-bfe2-d81c72edfd13" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "C=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fd2d7f86-1899-5971-8da0-f2042a0e6b74" :answer/id #uuid "fd2d7f86-1899-5971-8da0-f2042a0e6b74" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "C=6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-65c90b5a-a03b-5bf6-8480-c7c62bfe9030" :answer/id #uuid "65c90b5a-a03b-5bf6-8480-c7c62bfe9030" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "C=8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186068711 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-dbb8c729-ab7f-5cd4-a54a-d589b9fc5814"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-dbb8c729-ab7f-5cd4-a54a-d589b9fc5814" :question/id #uuid "dbb8c729-ab7f-5cd4-a54a-d589b9fc5814" :question/math-academy-id "q-215134" :question/problem "Written in **ascending order**, the solutions to $|9-y|=4$ are $y=${{field-1}} and $y=$\n{{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "Either the positive or negative of the expression inside the absolute value must be equal to the right-hand side of the equation.\n\nSo, we set up the two corresponding equations and solve them independently:\n\n- If $|9-y|=9-y,$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|9-y| & =4 \\\\ 9-y & =4 \\\\ -y & =-5 \\\\ y & =5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $|9-y|=-(9-y),$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|9-y| & =4 \\\\ -(9-y) & =4 \\\\ -9+y & =4 \\\\ y & =13\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, in ascending order, the solutions are $y=5$ and $y=13.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-08683cb0-0568-5527-8640-5395efa58e06" "answer-field-87d09cd1-be9d-5d97-9558-cf66eb1f306a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-08683cb0-0568-5527-8640-5395efa58e06" :answer-field/id #uuid "08683cb0-0568-5527-8640-5395efa58e06" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-17e936a5-a46e-5f28-bee3-fe36f08d04ce" :answer-field/choices ["answer-17e936a5-a46e-5f28-bee3-fe36f08d04ce"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-17e936a5-a46e-5f28-bee3-fe36f08d04ce" :answer/id #uuid "17e936a5-a46e-5f28-bee3-fe36f08d04ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-87d09cd1-be9d-5d97-9558-cf66eb1f306a" :answer-field/id #uuid "87d09cd1-be9d-5d97-9558-cf66eb1f306a" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-a7870dc6-533c-55cb-a45b-d1c9d01bcb2a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-a7870dc6-533c-55cb-a45b-d1c9d01bcb2a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a7870dc6-533c-55cb-a45b-d1c9d01bcb2a" :answer/id #uuid "a7870dc6-533c-55cb-a45b-d1c9d01bcb2a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "13" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186054771 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-66604494-d5d9-5eb8-81e3-a76e00656f7f"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-66604494-d5d9-5eb8-81e3-a76e00656f7f" :question/id #uuid "66604494-d5d9-5eb8-81e3-a76e00656f7f" :question/math-academy-id "q-154008" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $-\\frac{y}{3}\\le 3.$" :question/worked-solution "The variable $y$ is being *divided* by $3.$ To isolate $y$ and remove the negative sign, we *multiply* by $-3.$ \n\nRemember, when multiplying or dividing an inequality by a negative number, we need to flip the inequality sign:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-\\frac{y}{3}\\,\\, & \\le \\,\\,3 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{3})\\,\\, & \\ge \\,\\,(-3)\\cdot 3 \\\\ (-3)\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{3})\\,\\, & \\ge \\,\\,-9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince two negative numbers multiply to give a positive number, we first cancel the negatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-3)\\cdot (-\\frac{y}{3}) & \\ge -9 \\\\ (\\cancel{-}3)\\cdot (\\cancel{-}\\frac{y}{3}) & \\ge -9 \\\\ 3\\cdot \\frac{y}{3} & \\ge -9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can cancel a common factor of $3$ from both the numerator and denominator.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3\\cdot \\frac{y}{3} & \\ge -9 \\\\ \\frac{3y}{3} & \\ge -9 \\\\ \\frac{\\cancel{3}y}{\\cancel{3}} & \\ge -9 \\\\ y & \\ge -9\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $y\\ge -9.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-4e4a26f0-ed0b-57e8-a627-d6b00292461a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4e4a26f0-ed0b-57e8-a627-d6b00292461a" :answer-field/id #uuid "4e4a26f0-ed0b-57e8-a627-d6b00292461a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-00426310-f76d-56f6-ba30-c47b331278a2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9f72d829-4271-58e8-a988-e7422040bc4d" "answer-00426310-f76d-56f6-ba30-c47b331278a2" "answer-dc2f9355-cedb-5f9d-876c-a0aae0d73911" "answer-40f2638c-2ac7-53e0-a8a3-97b62783762e" "answer-4b95ea89-bff8-543e-8bf5-469472004602"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9f72d829-4271-58e8-a988-e7422040bc4d" :answer/id #uuid "9f72d829-4271-58e8-a988-e7422040bc4d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y\\ge -1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-00426310-f76d-56f6-ba30-c47b331278a2" :answer/id #uuid "00426310-f76d-56f6-ba30-c47b331278a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y\\ge -9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dc2f9355-cedb-5f9d-876c-a0aae0d73911" :answer/id #uuid "dc2f9355-cedb-5f9d-876c-a0aae0d73911" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y\\ge 9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-40f2638c-2ac7-53e0-a8a3-97b62783762e" :answer/id #uuid "40f2638c-2ac7-53e0-a8a3-97b62783762e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y\\le -9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4b95ea89-bff8-543e-8bf5-469472004602" :answer/id #uuid "4b95ea89-bff8-543e-8bf5-469472004602" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y\\le 1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186064329 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-840068df-b5bb-5a8c-a125-569067cf40da"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-840068df-b5bb-5a8c-a125-569067cf40da" :question/id #uuid "840068df-b5bb-5a8c-a125-569067cf40da" :question/math-academy-id "q-111663" :question/problem "$\\frac{{s}^{2}}{25}-\\frac{1}{81}$ is equivalent to" :question/worked-solution "First, we write the expression as a difference of squares:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{s}^{2}}{25}-\\frac{1}{81}={(\\frac{s}{5})}^{2}-{(\\frac{1}{9})}^{2}\n$$\n\nThen, we factor the expression using the difference of squares formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\frac{s}{5})}^{2}-{(\\frac{1}{9})}^{2}=(\\frac{s}{5}+\\frac{1}{9})(\\frac{s}{5}-\\frac{1}{9}) & .\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-77716a4d-fef6-5073-82d5-f3b9f059ff15"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-77716a4d-fef6-5073-82d5-f3b9f059ff15" :answer-field/id #uuid "77716a4d-fef6-5073-82d5-f3b9f059ff15" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-33e05cb0-0d11-5a48-ae94-2df779dd5f0d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-3d3da440-df14-5563-8357-d5962df16751" "answer-f3f16648-6db8-53b7-95d5-df7ac3de4c04" "answer-6b0dd266-8b12-51fc-9c32-a952e58010e2" "answer-33e05cb0-0d11-5a48-ae94-2df779dd5f0d" "answer-df3163ca-87f7-559b-8a74-14ac6aab05d5"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3d3da440-df14-5563-8357-d5962df16751" :answer/id #uuid "3d3da440-df14-5563-8357-d5962df16751" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{s}{3}-\\frac{1}{5})(\\frac{s}{3}-\\frac{1}{5})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f3f16648-6db8-53b7-95d5-df7ac3de4c04" :answer/id #uuid "f3f16648-6db8-53b7-95d5-df7ac3de4c04" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{s}{5}+\\frac{1}{3})(\\frac{s}{5}-\\frac{1}{3})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6b0dd266-8b12-51fc-9c32-a952e58010e2" :answer/id #uuid "6b0dd266-8b12-51fc-9c32-a952e58010e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{s}{5}+\\frac{1}{9})(\\frac{s}{5}+\\frac{1}{9})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-33e05cb0-0d11-5a48-ae94-2df779dd5f0d" :answer/id #uuid "33e05cb0-0d11-5a48-ae94-2df779dd5f0d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{s}{5}+\\frac{1}{9})(\\frac{s}{5}-\\frac{1}{9})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-df3163ca-87f7-559b-8a74-14ac6aab05d5" :answer/id #uuid "df3163ca-87f7-559b-8a74-14ac6aab05d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(\\frac{s}{9}+\\frac{1}{5})(\\frac{s}{9}-\\frac{1}{5})" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186068850 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-c6c9bca9-ea70-5989-b840-49d437c3ef76"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-c6c9bca9-ea70-5989-b840-49d437c3ef76" :question/id #uuid "c6c9bca9-ea70-5989-b840-49d437c3ef76" :question/math-academy-id "q-52490" :question/problem "$\\sqrt[3]{-{x}^{3}}=$" :question/worked-solution "We write the term under the radical as a perfect cube, and simplify:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{-{x}^{3}} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{-x\\cdot x\\cdot x} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{(-x)\\cdot (-x)\\cdot (-x)} & = \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{(-x)^{3}} & = \\\\ -x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c7d07edc-50fb-51a7-81d6-22b65ff2e867"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c7d07edc-50fb-51a7-81d6-22b65ff2e867" :answer-field/id #uuid "c7d07edc-50fb-51a7-81d6-22b65ff2e867" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8ab00684-1404-54cc-8b78-5a8eed09285d" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0826b2a3-5ac7-5dcc-ac1d-bf03465aeb17" "answer-8ab00684-1404-54cc-8b78-5a8eed09285d" "answer-27bed5b6-f163-5dd7-8925-f268bc816087" "answer-af753c10-bf82-5a32-9969-0aabdfdf7f04" "answer-9556c8b9-a5b5-559b-8d5e-07a1166eca58"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0826b2a3-5ac7-5dcc-ac1d-bf03465aeb17" :answer/id #uuid "0826b2a3-5ac7-5dcc-ac1d-bf03465aeb17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8ab00684-1404-54cc-8b78-5a8eed09285d" :answer/id #uuid "8ab00684-1404-54cc-8b78-5a8eed09285d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-27bed5b6-f163-5dd7-8925-f268bc816087" :answer/id #uuid "27bed5b6-f163-5dd7-8925-f268bc816087" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-af753c10-bf82-5a32-9969-0aabdfdf7f04" :answer/id #uuid "af753c10-bf82-5a32-9969-0aabdfdf7f04" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9556c8b9-a5b5-559b-8d5e-07a1166eca58" :answer/id #uuid "9556c8b9-a5b5-559b-8d5e-07a1166eca58" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{x}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186068805 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6410f1b3-233a-5db4-a768-91ae7f99b09a"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-6410f1b3-233a-5db4-a768-91ae7f99b09a" :question/id #uuid "6410f1b3-233a-5db4-a768-91ae7f99b09a" :question/math-academy-id "q-3479" :question/problem "What is $\\frac{3t+6}{4t+8}$ reduced to its lowest terms?" :question/worked-solution "We factor the numerator and denominator and cancel any factors that they have in common.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3t+6}{4t+8} & =\\frac{3\\cdot (t+2)}{4\\cdot (t+2)} \\\\  & =\\frac{3\\cdot \\cancel{(t+2)}}{4\\cdot \\cancel{(t+2)}} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-a641e9d4-b840-5597-8